# ProjectTrack Web Client Environment Configuration

# Base URL pointing to the FastAPI Backend Gateway
# The browser only ever talks to this backend — auth, data, and reports
# all flow through it (Supabase is backend-only, never exposed here).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# "Get an App" button target (Android APK). Set this to the direct .apk asset
# on a GitHub Release so the button downloads it immediately, e.g.:
#   VITE_APK_URL=https://github.com/ThirdTempest/ProjectTRACK/releases/download/v1.0.0/ProjectTRACK.apk
# If a .apk URL is given the button triggers a direct download; otherwise it
# falls back to the repo's releases page
# (https://github.com/ThirdTempest/ProjectTRACK/releases/latest).
# VITE_APK_URL=
